WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:05.168
What powers your home, day and night?

2
00:00:05.412 --> 00:00:10.692
On sunny days, solar powers your home and stores surplus energy in the battery.

3
00:00:10.953 --> 00:00:18.033
When clouds reduce solar output, the grid fills the gap. In this setup, the battery stays idle.

4
00:00:18.287 --> 00:00:23.567
After sunset, the battery powers your home using energy stored during the day.

5
00:00:23.828 --> 00:00:31.628
At the battery's reserve level, discharge stops. An available grid takes over, preserving the remaining charge.
